<p class="lead">The quickest way to reach the owner is through LinkedIn or Facebook. Please say clearly what your message is about.</p>

<div class="owner owner-compact">
  <div class="owner-avatar" aria-hidden="true"><%= SITE.ownerInitials %></div>
  <div class="owner-body">
    <h3><%= SITE.owner %></h3>
    <p class="owner-role"><%= SITE.ownerRole %></p>
    <p class="owner-links">
      <a class="btn btn-sm" href="<%= SITE.linkedin %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><%- icon('linkedin') %>Message on LinkedIn</a>
      <a class="btn btn-sm btn-ghost" href="<%= SITE.facebook %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><%- icon('facebook') %>Message on Facebook</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<h2>What to contact us about</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>A file that should not be here.</strong> For one-off problems, use "Report a problem" on the file page. For copyright claims, follow the <a href="/copyright">takedown steps</a>.</li>
  <li><strong>A bug or something that is not working.</strong> Tell us the page you were on and what happened.</li>
  <li><strong>A missing department or course.</strong> You can add courses yourself while uploading. For a new department, send us the code and full name.</li>
  <li><strong>Deleting your account or data.</strong> Send the email address you registered with.</li>
  <li><strong>Becoming a moderator.</strong> Tell us your department and what semester you are in.</li>
  <li><strong>Ideas and feedback.</strong> We read all of it.</li>
</ul>
